View images in a clean window with no toolbars or distractions

qView is an image viewer built around minimalism: the window shows just your image and a title bar, with everything else tucked into a right-click menu and keyboard shortcuts. It opens almost instantly and switches between images quickly while using little memory and CPU.

- Distraction-free interface with only the image and a title bar
- Fast startup and multithreaded preloading of neighbouring images
- Controls for animated GIFs
- Rotate and mirror images
- Recent file history and many configurable preferences
- Supports common formats including JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP, TIFF and BMP
